EN:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}"Hmmmm...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} This town is not very
good in its current state, hm?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}"It may be time to work hard to turn
these lemons into lemonade, yes?"{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

IT:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}"Mmmh...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Questa città non è
